    "updated_at": "2026-08-26T21:51:49Z",
    "body": "I also created my own version of this, in particular, aside from SSH, I wante devcontainers on WSL to work: https://github.com/pupeno/zed/tree/remote-devcontainer\r\n\r\nIt's also mostly AI, but I was starting to self review. I think I need to break it into smaller PRs. But some of the PRs overlap with: https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/pull/60975\r\n\r\nWe should probably sync up, and not duplicate efforts. There's clearly a few of us that want or need this.",
